{"id": "68756", "title": "阿黛", "author": "糖拌饭", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 46, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/68/68756.htm", "intro": "王黛穿越了！左邻，宁采臣刚刚把聂小倩领进门。右舍，许仙他姐正喊他打酱油，断桥相会还待来日。家里，老爹病重在床，老娘牢骚满腹，大哥游手好闲，大嫂好吃懒做，再加上事事跟她不对付的二姐，抬头望天，从此彪悍的人生不需要解释！！！！", "base": "files/article/html/68/68756", "chapters": [{"title": "断更说明", "file": "10544362.html", "available": false}, {"title": "新书《家业》上传", "file": "10544363.html", "available": false}, {"title": "恢复更文公告", "file": "10544364.html", "available": false}, {"title": "请假一天", "file": "10544365.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一章 贫贱之家百事哀", "file": "10544366.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章 鱼群和道人（修）", "file": "10544367.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章 防火防盗防道人", "file": "10544368.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章 生活不容易（修）", "file": "10544369.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章 借钱（修）", "file": "10544370.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章 王成（修）", "file": "10544371.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章 外圆内方（修）", "file": "10544372.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章 姜氏的心思（修）", "file": "10544373.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章 神龟负书（修）", "file": "10544374.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章 王靛的劫", "file": "10544375.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章 落网", "file": "10544376.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章 胡婆婆（修）", "file": "10544377.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章 更夫", "file": "10544378.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一十四章 夜谈", "file": "10544379.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一十五章 云腾致雨", "file": "10544380.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一十六章 打架", "file": "10544381.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一十七章 胡大嫂的脉相", "file": "10544382.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章 宿慧", "file": "10544383.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一十九章 出发", "file": "10544384.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章 于老先生", "file": "10544385.html", "available": false